# Drop non-Windows native binaries shipped inside multi-arch npm packages
# (e.g. @anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk vendor audio-capture).
**/vendor/**/*-darwin*/**
**/vendor/**/*darwin*/**
**/vendor/**/*-linux*/**
**/vendor/**/*linux*/**
**/prebuilds/darwin-*/**
**/prebuilds/linux-*/**
**/bin/darwin-*/**
**/bin/linux-*/**
